{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876150?t=1771984050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771984050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/52a82f0b9bfca6ec8c0f521237d93814ecb8baf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771984050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/52a82f0b9bfca6ec8c0f521237d93814ecb8baf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771984050","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4241990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1771984050\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1771984050\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1771984050\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Combo Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/96dcdfa9230a6e9d94949319670575cbfadab13b/header.jpg?t=1771984050","is_free":false,"linux_require